    Given a live streaming video, LSTR sequentially identifies the actions happening in each incoming frame by using an encoder-decoder architecture, without future context.
    The dashed brown arrows indicate the data flow of the long- and short-term memories following the first-in-first-out (FIFO) logic.
    (Best viewed in color.)
    }
    \vspace{-5pt}
